.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv*/
*.egg-info/

# Market data and generated/release artifacts are governed by their own
# manifests and must never be copied into source control.  The bare names
# matter as much as the trailing-slash forms: a fresh worktree links `data` to
# the materialized payload, and git treats that symlink as a file, so `data/`
# alone would not ignore it.
data
data/
inputs/
outputs/
reports/
artifacts/
archive/

# Research runs write under outputs/, which is already ignored above. The
# frozen experiments/ tree of v1.2-era manifests and result ledgers was retired
# on 2026-09-06, and the runner templates that briefly lived in configs/research/
# went with the Phase 5 and Phase 6 runners on the same date. No research
# manifest template is tracked any more.

# coverage artefacts
.coverage
.coverage.*

# macOS/iCloud sync duplicates ("observation 2.py", "registry_v1_3 3.yaml").
# The Desktop is iCloud-synced, so conflicting saves land as " 2", " 3", …
# siblings that are byte-identical to the original and belong to no commit.
* [0-9].*
